OL,3,AFive arrested for inciting racial
OL,4,Ahatred outside Jewish group's
OL,5,Aheadquarters, says Met
OL,6,
OL,7,FFive people have been arrested on
OL,8,Fsuspicion of inciting racial hatred at
OL,9,Fa protest outside the office of the
OL,10,FBoard of Deputies of British Jews in
OL,11,Fnorth London, the Metropolitan Police
OL,12,Fsaid.
OL,14,FThe force said they were detained when
OL,15,Fa "spontaneous protest" was staged
OL,16,Foutside the Camden headquarters of the
OL,17,FUK's largest Jewish community group.
