OL,3,AFive arrested for inciting racial
OL,4,Ahatred outside Jewish group's
OL,5,Aheadquarters, says Met
OL,6,
OL,7,FElsewhere, two people were arrested at
OL,8,Fa larger student pro-Palestinian
OL,9,Fprotest in central London - one for
OL,10,Fbreach of conditions and a second for
OL,11,Fcommon assault.
OL,13,FThe arrests came as a number of student
OL,14,Fpro-Palestinian protests were taking
OL,15,Fplace in London three years on from the
OL,16,F7 October attack on Israel by Hamas, in
OL,17,Fwhich around 1,200 people were killed
OL,18,Fand 251 others were taken as hostages
OL,19,Fby the militant group.
